    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-beauty-salon/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Beauty Salon is a sophisticated, feature-rich theme designed for beauty salons, hair salons, spas, wellness centers, and cosmetology businesses, offering a visually appealing platform to showcase services and build a strong online presence in the beauty spa niche. With an elegant modern design, high-quality imagery, and a responsive layout, it boasts a luxurious color palette. The homepage highlights a variety of offerings, including hair treatments, facials, manicures, pedicures, massage therapy, skincare, and makeup services, complemented by gallery displays and stylist showcases that enhance the ambiance. Functionality includes an online appointment system and Contact Form 7 compatibility for seamless scheduling. Customization options cover colors, fonts, layouts, SEO-friendly elements, and salon management tools. The theme also supports promotions, testimonials, before-and-after galleries, and social media integration, while focusing on services such as salon branding, nail artistry, peeling treatments, and sugaring services to provide a comprehensive beauty experience."
    },
